r, something has come up.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: From the tone of your voice, I conclude this is a serious matter.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: He is starting to become somewhat of a liability.", "time": "1"}, {"image": "engenn10le15ob09re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Adam? How?<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: His behavior as of late has been quite bizarre. As you are aware, he has presented the office with his presentation on our current office layout and suggested that it should be improved.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Right, and I must say that it was a rather informative presentation. He put a lot of research into it.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: I don't know if I would call it \u201cresearch\u201d per se.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>:  Judging by your reply, you don't seem to share my opinion on this matter.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: No I don't. It's because Adam has been disrupting the work of others. He believes that what he was doing was helping others but it came across as more of a disturbance in the office.", "time": "19500"}, {"image": "engenn10le15ob09re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Your comments imply that is an urgent matter that needs to be addressed. Why was this not brought to my attention earlier, Boris?<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: I thought I had taken care of it. I spoke to Mr. Bari about his actions earlier in the week. He seemed to understand where I was coming from. I didn't realize that he was still continuing on with it until he made his presentation today.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: What you are saying in so many words is that I need to have a talk with him.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Yes.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Consider it taken care of. I'll speak to Mr. Bari right away.", "time": "58700"}], "coverimg": "engenn10le15ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}